OL,3,AStorm Boelo brings 85mph gusts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption with amber weather
OL,5,Awarnings in effect
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing in wind gusts
OL,8,Fof 85mph (137 km/h) and further
OL,9,Fdisruption for the second day
OL,11,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,12,Facross large parts of Scotland,
OL,13,Fnorthern England and parts of Northern
OL,14,FIreland
OL,16,FA further yellow warning for wind will
OL,17,Fremain in place until 21:00 GMT for
OL,18,Fmost of Scotland, including the Orkney
OL,19,FIslands, and northern England
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
